{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Maneti Skin 是一款極簡護膚追蹤與美容儀式規劃 App，適合想建立穩定護膚習慣、避免漏掉每個步驟的使用者。它目前由原價 US $0.99 限時免費，可透過 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-12.webp\">\n<h2>招財貓陪伴養成護膚習慣</h2>\n<p>App 以招財貓吉祥物陪伴完成每個護膚步驟，並可自訂晨間與晚間儀式，透過 iOS 小工具查看鎖定畫面進度。內置成分圖鑑與儀式指南，涵蓋維他命 C、視黃醇及透明質酸等活性成分。Glow 儀錶板顯示多日趨勢、連續達標日數與可收集護身符，Maneti AI 完全在裝置本機運作，分析現有程序並提供即時建議。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-399-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-400-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-401-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-402-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-403-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-404-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Maneti Skin</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.541078+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:25:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:17:44.803794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:44.605831+00:00","content_hash":"20ab12452c83a95acf20d65ac9820510f2a30b8e102e2babeabfcc57a01767b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}